{
  "name": "dsh-shinki-git-graph",
  "version": "0.9.1",
  "description": "DSH 侧边栏 Git 图谱插件：分支树 + Git Extensions 风格曲线泳道提交图（浅色/深色主题各自配色） + 点击展开提交详情 + 写操作（暂存/提交/丢弃/分支切换/新建分支/检出提交）+ 同步（pull/push/fetch-all，含 tag）。默认显示当前分支与其上游远程分支，可选显示全部本地/远程分支。工作区本身非 git 时自动探测子目录 git 仓库，折叠列表 + 分页展开分别管理。",
  "type": "module",
  "main": "lib/index.js",
  "exports": {
    ".": "./lib/index.js",
    "./client": "./lib/client.js",
    "./package.json": "./package.json"
  },
  "dsh": {
    "bundle": {
      "patch": "./cordis.patch.yml"
    },
    "client": {
      "inject": [
        "@deepseek-ai/dsh-client-modules",
        "@deepseek-ai/dsh-client-locale"
      ],
      "platform": "web"
    }
  },
  "files": [
    "lib",
    "cordis.patch.yml",
    "README.md"
  ],
  "keywords": [
    "dsh",
    "dsh-plugin",
    "git",
    "git-graph",
    "sidebar",
    "visualization"
  ],
  "license": "Apache-2.0",
  "engines": {
    "node": ">=20"
  },
  "scripts": {
    "test": "node --test"
  }
}
